  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector and Small and Medium-sized Enterprises Development - Subprogram 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A grant of $15,000,000 is proposed for subprogram 2 of the Private Sector and Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises Development Program (PSME)&#x2014;the second grant of a program cluster to build on support initiated under subprogram 1, approved by the Asian Development Bank (ADB) in September 2007. Subprogram 2 is to be provided as a single tranche, based on completed prior actions demonstrating satisfactory progress. The subprogram 2 focuses on implementing business climate reforms and SME institutional development. Subprogram 2 supports the Government&apos;s efforts to improve trade policy capacity, especially as the Lao PDR increases its efforts preparing for WTO accession.</narrative>
  </description>
